  "abstract": "<jats:p>Scaling intensity-modulated direct-detection (IM/DD) interconnects to 400 Gb/s per lane demands innovations across modulators, photodiodes, amplifiers, and fibers. This paper analyzes high-speed E/O components, modulation formats, and design strategies enabling energy-efficient 400 Gb/s data-center links.</jats:p>",
